---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const sectionHeading = "font-display text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-pdw-ink border-b-2 border-pdw-tan pb-2 inline-block";
const body = "mt-4 text-sm text-pdw-body";
const list = "mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm text-pdw-body";
const link = "text-pdw-tan-dark underline hover:text-pdw-ink";
---

<Layout title="Terms and Conditions" description="Terms and conditions for using the Peak Defense Works website and ordering products.">
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-pdw-dark">
    <img
      src="/images/stock/desert-range.jpg"
      alt="Range in the Utah desert"
      class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-40"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-pdw-dark via-pdw-dark/80 to-pdw-dark/50"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 lg:px-10">
      <p class="font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-pdw-tan">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl font-bold uppercase text-pdw-white sm:text-4xl">Terms and Conditions</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-pdw-white/70">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 lg:px-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-12">
      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>Overview</h2>
        <p class={body}>
          These terms govern your use of this website and any order placed with Peak Defense Works, based in
          Central Utah. By using this site or placing an order, you accept these terms. See also our
          <a class={link} href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>Products and Availability</h2>
        <p class={body}>
          Peak Defense Works designs and 3D prints chassis systems and accessories for the Taurus TX22 in Central
          Utah. This storefront is currently a demo in progress &mdash; our full catalog and checkout are still
          being built out, so pricing, availability, and product details on this site may change without notice
          until ordering goes live.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>Orders and Payment</h2>
        <p class={body}>
          Once checkout is live, orders will be processed through a secure third-party payment processor. We do
          not store your full payment card information on our servers. Orders are not confirmed until payment is
          successfully processed.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>Shipping and Returns</h2>
        <ul class={list}>
          <li>Flat-rate shipping to the lower 48 states, calculated at checkout.</li>
          <li>Most orders leave the shop within 4 to 6 business days.</li>
          <li>Order issues or return requests are handled directly by email &mdash; contact us and we'll work with you.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>Product Use and Legal Compliance</h2>
        <p class={body}>
          Peak Defense Works sells chassis systems, braces, and accessories &mdash; we do not sell firearms.
          Products are sold for lawful use only. It is your responsibility to know and follow all federal, state,
          and local laws that apply to firearm accessories, pistol braces, and any resulting configuration in
          your jurisdiction before you buy or install a product. We reserve the right to refuse or cancel any
          order where we believe the product cannot be lawfully possessed or used.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>Site Content and Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class={body}>
          All website content, product photos, and branding belong to Peak Defense Works and may not be reused
          without permission.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class={body}>
          To the extent permitted by law, our total liability for any claim related to a product or order is
          limited to the amount you paid for that order, and we are not liable for indirect or consequential
          damages. Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot be limited under Utah law.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>Governing Law and Disputes</h2>
        <p class={body}>
          These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Utah. Any dispute will be resolved in the courts
          of Utah, after a good-faith attempt to resolve it directly with us first.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p class={body}>
          We may update these terms as the site and storefront develop, especially once checkout goes live. Any
          changes will be posted on this page with an updated date at the top.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class={sectionHeading}>Contact</h2>
        <p class={body}>If you have questions about these terms, reach out at:</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-pdw-body">
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a class={link} href="mailto:support@peakdefenseworks.com">support@peakdefenseworks.com</a></li>
          <li><strong>Location:</strong> Central Utah</li>
        </ul>
        <p class={body}>See also our <a class={link} href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
